WEBVTT

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:39.420
After a whole lot of nonsense,
we finally found Amelia and Gourry...

00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:41.190
...and we're all back together.

00:01:41.270 --> 00:01:44.570
So, who were those two we saw
at the Pillar of Light before?

00:01:44.640 --> 00:01:47.330
And what about the five
weapons and Darkstar?

00:01:47.410 --> 00:01:49.670
Anyway, it looks like we're
close to this story's climax!

00:02:09.430 --> 00:02:11.330
The Pillar of Light...

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:13.630
The color's changed, but it
definitely looks like...

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:15.290
...the systems there
are still working.

00:02:15.740 --> 00:02:17.230
Yeah...

00:02:17.770 --> 00:02:19.170
"Dragon's blood shall spread..."

00:02:19.910 --> 00:02:22.770
"...and following the power
between light and darkness..."

00:02:22.840 --> 00:02:24.370
"...a single star
shall be awakened."

00:02:24.780 --> 00:02:26.940
That prophecy
from before, right?

00:02:27.010 --> 00:02:30.110
Yes. The prophecy
must mean that...

00:02:30.180 --> 00:02:32.170
...to save the world
from Darkstar...

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:34.220
Miss Lina, you're the
only one who can.

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:37.780
Everything stems from
the Pillar of Light.

00:02:37.860 --> 00:02:39.490
All right, that settles it!

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:41.920
You people!

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:46.520
You look like you WANT me
to throw you all into the sea!

00:02:47.130 --> 00:02:50.970
You don't have time
to be relaxin'! Get to work!

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:54.370
You should be glad we let
you come on our ship for free!

00:02:57.380 --> 00:03:01.010
Oh! Why couldn't we have any
money to pay for this ride?!

00:03:01.450 --> 00:03:04.420
Because SOMEBODY ate
us into bankruptcy.

00:03:06.490 --> 00:03:08.890
Keep slackin' and
you'll get no dinner!

00:03:08.960 --> 00:03:11.290
Agh! No!
Sorry! Forgive us!

00:03:27.010 --> 00:03:30.340
Palu! Dinner's ready!

00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:33.010
Palu!

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:35.950
Coming!

00:03:40.750 --> 00:03:43.990
Uncle! Uncle!

00:03:46.190 --> 00:03:48.630
Mama says dinner's ready.

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:53.860
Huh? Uncle, did somebody die?

00:03:54.230 --> 00:03:57.830
Yes... Someone
important to me is dead.

00:03:57.900 --> 00:04:01.430
Two very important
people, in fact.

00:04:01.510 --> 00:04:03.000
Oh...

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:14.310
It was time to
make graves for them...

00:04:17.160 --> 00:04:19.350
All right, let's go
home to your mom.

00:04:19.430 --> 00:04:20.480
'Kay!

00:04:21.730 --> 00:04:23.490
You hungry, Palu?

00:04:23.560 --> 00:04:25.720
Yeah, my stomach's growling!

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:36.200
I can't believe we've been
forced to come back here.

00:04:36.680 --> 00:04:40.980
There's no other way to
get to the Pillar of Light.

00:04:41.050 --> 00:04:43.310
It seems to be abandoned.

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:46.980
Anyway, let's try to get to the
room with that magical device.

00:04:54.830 --> 00:04:56.300
It was here, wasn't it?

00:04:56.360 --> 00:04:59.360
This magical device transported
us to the Pillar of Light before.

00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:02.090
All right!
Let's get going, then!

00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:05.700
Yeah! I left my sword
there, too, remember?

00:05:05.770 --> 00:05:08.570
Okay, then! Let's go!

00:05:11.310 --> 00:05:13.510
So... How do we activate it?

00:05:21.320 --> 00:05:24.050
We only barely managed
to close the gateway.

00:05:24.160 --> 00:05:27.150
But it's a gateway that
has been opened once already.

00:05:27.230 --> 00:05:29.960
We don't know how long it'll be
before he pushes his way through.

00:05:30.460 --> 00:05:35.260
We must find the remaining
weapon before then.

00:05:36.800 --> 00:05:40.400
I and my superiors
share your feelings.

00:06:10.400 --> 00:06:13.130
This light should
show us the way.

00:06:19.350 --> 00:06:22.370
Now go!
Find the final weapon!

00:06:38.930 --> 00:06:40.330
Well, Amelia?

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:44.460
It's no use. I can't see
anything suspicious here.

00:06:45.310 --> 00:06:48.830
We'll never get to the Pillar
of Light at this rate!

00:07:02.620 --> 00:07:04.390
What?! What's going on?!

00:07:05.460 --> 00:07:07.790
Why are those
things coming out now?!

00:07:11.330 --> 00:07:13.160
They're coming from
the Pillar of Light...

00:07:29.620 --> 00:07:32.210
Those creatures are
following the trail...

00:07:32.290 --> 00:07:34.650
...left by an intense
energy burst!

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:36.450
And it came from
the Pillar of Light!

00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:39.820
Something important
must be at the end of it.

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:44.730
Lord Valgaav... Boss Gravos...

00:07:45.670 --> 00:07:47.360
I'll never forget you.

00:07:48.770 --> 00:07:50.100
Boss Gravos...

00:07:50.770 --> 00:07:52.930
Lina, the one I swore
vengeance on for the boss...

00:07:53.470 --> 00:07:55.940
...was killed in the explosion
at the Pillar of Light.

00:07:56.740 --> 00:07:59.510
Lord Valgaav
was killed as well...

00:08:00.150 --> 00:08:04.010
I wandered alone
all over. All alone...

00:08:07.350 --> 00:08:12.850
Everyone's gone...
I'm all alone!

00:08:13.760 --> 00:08:15.250
Figured you'd be here.

00:08:19.230 --> 00:08:20.720
What's wrong, Palu?

00:08:20.800 --> 00:08:24.900
You just left suddenly.
I thought you were gone for good.

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:33.210
I'm not going anywhere.
I promise I won't.

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:42.920
You know, this is near
where we first met.

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:50.930
Yeah... It was here.

00:08:59.210 --> 00:09:02.440
Lord... Valgaav...

00:09:15.520 --> 00:09:18.080
Mama, he's alive! He's alive!

00:09:38.850 --> 00:09:42.610
It was the first time in my life
anyone was that nice to me.

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:45.550
I'd do anything
for you, Palu.

00:09:45.620 --> 00:09:47.880
And I like you, too, Uncle.

00:09:47.950 --> 00:09:50.120
Okay, Palu, let's go!

00:09:50.890 --> 00:09:55.330
Boss... Lord Valgaav...
I love Palu.

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:58.590
There are no bad humans here
to threaten these beast people.

00:09:58.670 --> 00:10:00.360
I'm happy.

00:10:00.430 --> 00:10:03.060
And I want to protect
this happiness I've found.

00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:29.490
What the?

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:45.180
You think those
creatures attacked them?

00:10:45.250 --> 00:10:46.680
I dunno...

00:10:47.050 --> 00:10:48.850
It looks that way.

00:10:49.220 --> 00:10:50.920
I asked the villagers.

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:53.820
They said a huge swarm
suddenly attacked them.

00:10:53.890 --> 00:10:55.120
I see...

00:10:55.200 --> 00:11:00.060
Except... They didn't
seem to attack any people.

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:03.360
They must be agents
of Darkstar, right?

00:11:03.570 --> 00:11:06.660
Either way,
we can't ignore this.

00:11:06.910 --> 00:11:08.900
You're right.

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:18.940
Mama-a-a!

00:11:19.190 --> 00:11:20.550
I'm home!

00:11:20.620 --> 00:11:21.810
Hello there.

00:11:21.890 --> 00:11:24.120
Uncle! Hurry up!

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:28.760
You're a fast runner, Palu.

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:31.630
Uncle, will you show me
how to shoot your gun?

00:11:31.700 --> 00:11:33.060
You know how, don't you?

00:11:33.630 --> 00:11:35.620
All right, all right...

00:11:42.180 --> 00:11:44.300
What's that noise?

00:11:46.480 --> 00:11:47.810
What's?

00:11:54.590 --> 00:11:56.320
They're headed for the town!

00:12:22.780 --> 00:12:23.940
Our house!

00:12:25.620 --> 00:12:27.550
Don't wreck our house!

00:12:28.620 --> 00:12:29.420
Palu!

00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:33.490
I won't let you hurt that boy!

00:12:37.100 --> 00:12:37.960
Uncle!

00:12:39.030 --> 00:12:42.870
Shoulda known better
than to try being heroic...

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:46.070
AGH! LEMME DOWN!

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:49.140
Lina! She's alive?!

00:12:53.210 --> 00:12:54.310
Uncle!

00:13:01.690 --> 00:13:03.680
Are you okay?
Was somebody hurt?

00:13:07.960 --> 00:13:09.690
LI NA I NVERSE!

00:13:11.200 --> 00:13:12.290
Jillas?!

00:13:12.530 --> 00:13:17.030
Jillas, thank goodness!
You're alive!

00:13:17.100 --> 00:13:19.330
You just drip insincerity,
you know that?

00:13:19.410 --> 00:13:20.960
Never in a hundred
years would l...

00:13:21.040 --> 00:13:24.200
Well, gotta go, Jillas!
You can handle the bugs here.

00:13:24.280 --> 00:13:26.300
Hey! Hold it!
Come back here!

00:13:26.980 --> 00:13:29.110
Uh, Jillas, behind you!

00:13:29.180 --> 00:13:32.080
Miss Lina, wait!
Aren't we going to help them?

00:13:42.530 --> 00:13:47.160
You're alive... The boss
will be avenged, Lina!

00:13:47.230 --> 00:13:50.290
She's alive! She's alive!

00:13:52.410 --> 00:13:53.630
Uncle...

00:13:58.240 --> 00:14:00.640
You creatures are wrong!

00:14:00.710 --> 00:14:03.650
I will not allow you to cause
suffering to innocent people!

00:14:06.150 --> 00:14:08.520
What are these
things trying to do?

00:14:09.460 --> 00:14:12.750
Well, now... Shall we take
them all out at once?

00:14:14.460 --> 00:14:15.620
Fire... BALL!

00:14:17.560 --> 00:14:19.690
All right!
They're pretty weak!

00:14:20.700 --> 00:14:22.030
Freeze Arrow!

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:30.000
Hey, this sword isn't half bad!

00:14:30.080 --> 00:14:31.770
Hah! Piece of cake!

00:14:38.180 --> 00:14:39.450
Interference?

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:40.820
I believe so.

00:14:40.890 --> 00:14:43.950
It's being done
by people I know.

00:14:44.020 --> 00:14:45.960
Very well, then.

00:14:46.030 --> 00:14:49.320
I see the search
has borne some fruit.

00:14:51.800 --> 00:14:55.130
These things weren't
made for fighting!

00:15:03.740 --> 00:15:05.180
That's...

00:15:07.780 --> 00:15:09.540
One of Almayce's people!

00:15:13.090 --> 00:15:14.990
My name is Erulogos.

00:15:15.460 --> 00:15:18.420
Are you the ones who are
killing my servants?

00:15:18.690 --> 00:15:19.750
What?

00:15:21.330 --> 00:15:24.460
You seem determined
to oppose us.

00:15:25.030 --> 00:15:27.020
Why are you even doing this?!

00:15:27.300 --> 00:15:30.170
I get it... They're looking
for the fifth weapon.

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:31.230
You people...

00:15:31.300 --> 00:15:32.570
Hold it, Amelia!

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:36.860
I don't know how much
Almayce may have told you...

00:15:36.940 --> 00:15:40.470
...but take my advice:
I'm not like Almayce!

00:15:41.010 --> 00:15:44.070
You definitely don't seem like
the type to be reasoned with.

00:15:44.850 --> 00:15:47.720
If you understand that,
then get lost.

00:15:52.060 --> 00:15:53.490
Did you see what he did?

00:15:53.560 --> 00:15:56.790
That body is just a shell...
Like Almayce!

00:15:57.430 --> 00:15:59.960
Meaning we can only do
hand to hand fighting!

00:16:00.030 --> 00:16:02.020
Just what I wanted to hear!

00:16:05.140 --> 00:16:06.610
I'll give it
my best shot, too!

00:16:14.910 --> 00:16:17.210
What are you
doing, UncleJillas?

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:18.680
Aren't you going
to save the town?

00:16:19.350 --> 00:16:20.510
UncleJillas!

00:16:20.720 --> 00:16:22.450
Look out!
Stay away from here!

00:16:23.890 --> 00:16:26.690
Uncle... You coward!

00:16:26.760 --> 00:16:27.590
Palu!

00:17:02.030 --> 00:17:03.190
Man, he's powerful!

00:17:06.070 --> 00:17:07.690
Uh-oh, he's through
playing around!

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:28.950
This is for the boss,
Lina Inverse!

00:17:29.020 --> 00:17:32.010
And this is for
Lord Valgaav, Overworlder!

00:17:32.930 --> 00:17:35.950
I'm going to blow you all up!

00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:39.460
Jillas! What do
you expect to do?!

00:17:39.800 --> 00:17:43.240
Palu... Now see how
I can fight!

00:18:11.200 --> 00:18:12.890
Don't move, Lina Inverse!

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:14.160
Oh, for crying out loud!

00:18:14.230 --> 00:18:16.860
Would you do something about
that stubborn streak of yours?!

00:18:16.940 --> 00:18:17.600
Miss Lina!

00:18:19.070 --> 00:18:22.600
Why did Almayce waste his time
with weaklings like you?

00:18:27.880 --> 00:18:28.970
We'll all die together.

00:18:29.620 --> 00:18:31.050
Uh-oh! Defense barriers, now!

00:18:44.230 --> 00:18:45.560
Uncle...

00:19:04.650 --> 00:19:08.020
So, it wasn't the
final weapon after all.

00:19:08.090 --> 00:19:13.460
But, then... Why did my
searchers react to this?

00:19:22.570 --> 00:19:24.400
He really went and did it.

00:19:24.700 --> 00:19:28.800
He built an explosive as
powerful as a Dragon Slave.

00:19:28.870 --> 00:19:30.170
Pretty impressive.

00:19:30.240 --> 00:19:32.180
Next time we meet... Huh?

00:19:34.610 --> 00:19:35.980
What's that?

00:19:36.050 --> 00:19:37.040
Uncle!

00:19:39.850 --> 00:19:41.220
Uncle!

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:50.390
You're okay! I'm sorry
I called you a coward!

00:19:50.460 --> 00:19:54.830
You really are strong!
C'mon, let's go home! C'mon!

00:19:55.530 --> 00:19:56.730
Palu...

00:19:58.140 --> 00:20:02.200
There's something I've gotta do.

00:20:02.510 --> 00:20:03.840
Gotta go...

00:20:05.810 --> 00:20:08.470
Why? Why?!

00:20:08.550 --> 00:20:11.740
No, you can't leave!
I don't want you to! No!

00:20:11.820 --> 00:20:12.880
Palu...

00:20:14.220 --> 00:20:17.350
Jillas must follow his own path.

00:20:18.190 --> 00:20:19.710
Mama?

00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:25.550
Uncle!

00:20:27.430 --> 00:20:31.700
The yield on that explosion was only
half of what it should have been.

00:20:31.940 --> 00:20:33.960
She's still alive.

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:37.200
I'll invent a more powerful
explosive. Until then...

00:20:38.110 --> 00:20:43.050
Uncle! Don't go! Uncle!

00:20:44.850 --> 00:20:46.940
Ow!

00:20:47.020 --> 00:20:50.080
But I'm not gonna cry!

00:20:50.960 --> 00:20:53.720
It's really sort
of dramatic, isn't it?

00:20:54.230 --> 00:20:56.790
I wonder what
happened to Mr. Jillas.

00:20:56.860 --> 00:20:57.950
I dunno.

00:20:58.560 --> 00:21:02.160
But let's just leave him
alone for now, okay?

00:22:22.010 --> 00:22:24.140
If the final Darkstar
weapon is found...

00:22:24.220 --> 00:22:27.520
Huh? A hero's appeared?!
You don't mean?!

00:22:27.590 --> 00:22:30.680
Next time: " A Hero's Advent?
For Whom Does the Young Girl Pray?

00:22:30.760 --> 00:22:33.220
You'd better watch, or I'll
REALLY cause some trouble!
